  "description": "TaskHub.Shared is a lightweight, modular shared kernel for .NET microservices. Built on DDD and Clean Architecture principles, it provides reusable primitives, CQRS pipelines, observability integrations (OpenTelemetry), and infrastructure adapters (EF Core, Redis, GeoCoding). Perfect for scalable task management systems. Explore modules for consistent cross-service patterns.",
